{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online PvP action and roguelike multiplayer combat.<strong></strong><br><br><br><br>Enjoy three unique modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PSI Masquerade</strong> \u2013 A versus mode where you fight using randomly assigned psychic powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transrealm Masquerade</strong> \u2013 A versus mode where you can bring in your own gear and companion characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deadly Wonderland</strong> \u2013 A roguelike action game that can be played both online and offline.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deadly Wonderland</strong> is a roguelike action game set in a mysterious otherworld.  <br>Explore procedurally generated dungeons, encounter a wide variety of items and enemies\u2014some of which can even join you as allies.<br><br>In the Playtest version, you can experience the first half of the beginner-level dungeon, Fairy Realm.       <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Story-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you come to, you find yourself in a small village inhabited by fairies. However, they despise trouble and drive you out of the village. With nowhere to go, you wander aimlessly through a forest bathed in hues of violet. In the dazzling castle that looms far in the distance, what could possibly await you?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758810/extras/characters_en.png?t=1750602870\" /></div> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2758810?t=1750602870","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2758810?t=1750602870","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758810/a088b8e18bc943ce24c194c72669142588f13282/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750602870","capsule_imagev5":"https://shar